<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Pakistan port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Sept 17 - Karachi - Two vessels waiting off port.</p>
<p>One general cargo, waiting two days. One fertiliser, waiting six days. Five other vessels laid up off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
